---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Job Search Engine | Miller Arias"
  description="Local-first pipeline for job searching with scraping, local LLM evaluation, CV generation, and complete tracking."
>
  <main
    class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-16 md:mt-24"
    transition:name="card-project-jobsearch"
  >
    <a
      href="/proyectos"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-3 text-sm font-mono text-neutral-500 hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors group"
    >
      <span class="inline-block transform group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform">
        ←
      </span>
      Back to projects
    </a>

    <header class="mb-12 mt-11">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
          Data Pipeline
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 text-neutral-400 text-xs font-mono rounded-full">
          100% Local-First
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 text-neutral-400 text-xs font-mono rounded-full">
          2026
        </span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-100 mb-6">
        Job Search Engine
      </h1>
      <p class="text-neutral-400 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Automated local-first pipeline for job searching. Scrapes multi-board
        job postings with JobSpy, evaluates fit against your profile using a
        local LLM (Ollama), generates tailored CVs and cover letters, converts
        them to PDF, and manages the entire application tracking process without
        paid APIs or sending data to third parties.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/Miller1999/job-search"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono bg-neutral-900 text-neutral-300 hover:text-white border border-neutral-800 hover:border-neutral-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl transition active:scale-[0.99]"
        >
          <span>View Repository on GitHub</span>
          <span class="text-neutral-600">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <hr class="border-neutral-900 my-12" />

    <section class="mb-[5.5rem]">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
        Tech Stack
      </h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-full text-xs text-neutral-200 font-mono">
          Python
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-full text-xs text-neutral-200 font-mono">
          uv
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-full text-xs text-neutral-200 font-mono">
          Ollama (deepseek-r1:14b)
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-full text-xs text-neutral-200 font-mono">
          python-jobspy
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-full text-xs text-neutral-200 font-mono">
          SQLite
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-full text-xs text-neutral-200 font-mono">
          Pandas
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-full text-xs text-neutral-200 font-mono">
          WeasyPrint
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-full text-xs text-neutral-200 font-mono">
          Pydantic
        </span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-[5.5rem]">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
        Pipeline End-to-End
      </h2>
      <div class="bg-neutral-900/30 border border-neutral-900 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-4 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-3 bg-neutral-900/60 rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/50">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0">
            1
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-neutral-200 font-bold">Multi-Board Ingestion</p>
            <p class="text-neutral-500">
              Scraping with JobSpy (Indeed, LinkedIn, Glassdoor) + manual posts
              from social media/WhatsApp.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center text-neutral-500">▼</div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-3 bg-neutral-900/60 rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/50">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0">
            2
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-neutral-200 font-bold">Local LLM Evaluation</p>
            <p class="text-neutral-500">
              0-100 scoring against profile.md, deal-breakers, seniority, and
              location with Ollama.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center text-neutral-500">▼</div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-3 bg-neutral-900/60 rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/50">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0">
            3
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-neutral-200 font-bold">Automated Tailoring</p>
            <p class="text-neutral-500">
              Generation of CVs and cover letters adapted per job posting, in
              English/Spanish.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center text-neutral-500">▼</div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-3 bg-neutral-900/60 rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/50">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0">
            4
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-neutral-200 font-bold">PDF + Tracking</p>
            <p class="text-neutral-500">
              Conversion with Pandoc/WeasyPrint, HTML/CSV dashboard, and
              application tracking.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-[5.5rem]">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
        Key Highlights
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-900 p-5 rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-200 mb-2">
            Unified Pipeline
          </h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            A single command (`daily.py`) chains the entire flow from scraping
            to PDFs and the application list.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-900 p-5 rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-200 mb-2">
            Manual Job Posts
          </h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Supports postings from Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, LinkedIn, or
            WhatsApp with LLM-based extraction.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-900 p-5 rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-200 mb-2">
            Smart Tracking
          </h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Status system, overdue follow-ups, ghosting detection, and
            deduplication across boards.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-900 p-5 rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-200 mb-2">Zero Cost</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            100% local with Ollama. No paid APIs, no sending sensitive data to
            the cloud.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="mt-24 pt-8 border-t border-neutral-800 text-center">
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500">
        Miller Arias • Job Search Engine • 2026
      </p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>
